   "beats": [
    {
     "day": 109,
     "text": "📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Wei Chen is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."
    },
    {
     "day": 109,
     "text": "🕯️ Wei is dead — and the dead hold no treaties. Every link Haven has shakes."
    },
    {
     "day": 109,
     "text": "Emberhold watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 950 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it."
    },
    {
     "day": 109,
     "text": "Stonebridge watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 950 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it."
    },
    {
     "day": 109,
     "text": "Thornfield watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 1,898 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it."
    },
    {
     "day": 109,
     "text": "🕯️ Wei Chen is dead — combat. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging."
    },
    {
     "day": 109,
     "text": "📖 LEARNED: Radios & Signals (Level 1). Continuity, batteries, and solder. Most dead electronics are just broken connections."
    },
    {
     "day": 109,
     "text": "⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."
    },
    {
     "day": 109,
     "text": "🌙 Watchers at the north treeline see torchlight moving in The Red Table's camp — and it going dark. Whatever was coming, the doubled watch turned it. The night stays quiet, and everyone at the fire understands why."
    },
    {
